  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cul-H 102.17 “Human remains” or “remains” means “human remains” or “remains” as defined in RSA 227-C:1,VII-a, namely “any part of the body of deceased human being in any stage of decomposition, together with any artifacts or other materials known or reliably assumed to have been on or interred with the deceased human being.”\n\nSource. #10217, eff 10-30-12, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
